---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { href } from "../lib/paths";
---
<Layout title="For Students | Kin & Campus">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">For students</div><h1>Learn care now. With a doctor who has your number.</h1><p class="lead">A local pediatrician in Blacksburg. Check-ins around finals and holidays. You have a say in the plan.</p></div>
<div class="w"><div class="grid"><div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg><h3>The plan stays with you</h3><p>The meds and the plan don't lapse in October. We keep them with you, and we teach you how to keep them yourself.</p></div><div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg><h3>A number you actually have</h3><p>A doctor eight minutes away. Check-ins before finals. After a holiday. When you get back from break.</p></div><div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-leaf"/></svg><h3>Learn this now</h3><p>Sleep, stress, the inhaler, what actually helps before a final. Learn care now, while someone will still sit with you.</p></div><div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg><h3>We figure it out with you</h3><p>At 18 the chart is yours. If you want a "call home if I'm actually sick" rule, we write it down and follow it.</p></div></div></div>
<section><div class="w"><div class="eyebrow">When students write us</div><h2>Sick days. Refills. A check-in before a final.</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>A sick day</h3><p>Same day in Blacksburg. A doctor who already knows you.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>The plan</h3><p>Refills and the list you already have, held here through the semester.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>The calendar</h3><p>A check-in before finals, after a holiday, the week you get back.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>The forms</h3><p>Travel, housing, athletics. We sit with you and get them done.</p></div></div>
<p style="margin-top:36px"><a class="btn" href={href("join")}>Reserve a spot</a></p></div></section>
</Layout>
